## 👋 hi, i'm x3fw

15 · she/her · Austria 🇦🇹

I'm a generalist tinkerer — one week I'm building websites, the next I'm
buttoning down custom firmware or poking at a scooter that nobody asked me
to poke at. If it has a UART port, it's fair game.

- 🛴 **Physics-defying hobbies** — Ninebot projects & custom firmware
- 🌐 **Web stuff** — HTML/CSS/JS, ship first, refactor later
- ⚙️ **Low level curiosity** — how firmware works, how to break it (nicely)
- 🧪 **currently** — rebuilding my whole corner of the internet, repo by repo

</br>

